DESCRIPTION:Dean Yip invites all students\, staff\, and faculty members to come out and cheer on our Engineering athletes at a Volleyball Double-Header. \nJoin us for free pizza and a memorable night of supporting our Blues Engineers! \nEvent Details:\nDate: Friday\, November 27\, 2026\nTime: 5:00 pm (Game starts at 5:30 pm)\n\nLocation: Meet at the GB lobby! \n\n\nHow to register:\n\nRegister by submitting this MS Form\nGet your FREE tickets here
