SUMMARY:Taiwan: Alumni Christmas & Year-End Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Attention U of T Engineering alumni! \nYour Taiwan alumni representatives warmly invite you and your family to join fellow U of T alumni in Taiwan for our 2026 Christmas & Year-End Dinner! \nThroughout 2026\, our Taiwan alumni community has continued to grow through various gatherings\, bringing together alumni from different generations\, professional backgrounds\, and industries. \nThis Christmas\, we look forward to reconnecting with old friends\, welcoming new alumni\, and celebrating another wonderful year together. \nGood food\, good company & great conversations! \nEvent Details \n\n\nDate: Friday\, December 25\, 2026 \n\n\nTime: 6:00 PM onwards \n\n\nVenue: Emerald Court (天成世貿國際會館・翠庭)\, Taipei International Convention Center (TICC) \n\n\nAddress: 2F\, No. 1\, Section 5\, Xinyi Road\, Xinyi District\, Taipei 110\, Taiwan \n\n\nDinner: Traditional Chinese Roasted Duck Banquet \n\n\nFee: NT$1\,360 per person \n\n\nRSVP Deadline: Friday\, December 18\, 2026 \n\n\nRegistration \n\n\nFamily and friends are warmly welcome. \nAs seating is limited\, we encourage early registration. Registration is confirmed upon completion of the Google Form and LINE Pay payment. \nOrganizing Committee – U of T Taiwan Alumni \nSolomon Chang\nSherry Hsieh\nChia-Herng Han\nYvie Chen\nFlorence Wu\nAmy Hung\nFertina Chen \nWe look forward to celebrating Christmas with our U of T alumni community in Taiwan! \n\nQuestions? \nEmail alumni.relations@engineering.utoronto.ca  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDiscover your Global Alumni Ambassadors (GAA) around the world—visit our GAA site for more details!
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/taiwan-alumni-christmas-year-end-dinner/
LOCATION:Emerald Court (天成世貿國際會館・翠庭)\, Taipei International Convention Center (TICC)
CATEGORIES:Alumni events
END:VEVENT
